                        },
                        {
                          "String": "Reported as not meeting GHS hazard criteria by 222 of 225 companies (only 1.3% companies provided GHS information). For more detailed information, please visit  ECHA C&L website.",
                          "Markup": [
                            {
                              "Start": 161,
